1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Meet Owefolk: shared tabs and clear friendships.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Sign in and see what you owe, what you are owed, and the group behind every balance.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Scan a receipt privately on-device, then review the merchant and total before saving.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Split equally, by exact amounts, or by percentage - always down to the cent.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Keep direct payer relationships, or simplify the group into fewer repayments.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:49,000
See who you owe, the exact amount, and their preferred payment provider and handle.

7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Open their payment method. Mark it sent only after paying; the recipient confirms it.

8
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Every member stays in sync through a clear shared activity history.

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Owefolk keeps fair math from getting awkward.
